{"id":"32c4e6b205cc3cd8","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finite-algebra.md","title":"Finite Algebra","display":"df-finite-algebra — Finite Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finite-algebra","aliases":["93-df-finite-algebra"],"display":"df-finite-algebra — Finite Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finite-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finite-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-algebra — Finite Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf A|\">\\(|\\mathbf A|\\)</span> is its carrier whenever the algebra conjunct holds.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantified similarity type makes this a genuine one-place predicate, while finiteness is tested on the actual carrier rather than on an unrelated free variable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf A$ is an algebra candidate, $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is from [[93-df-algebra]], and $|\\mathbf A|$ is its carrier whenever the algebra conjunct holds.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash \\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathbf A|)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1029,"backlinks":[{"id":"2cd98554615471be","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{CardLe}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}$ are sourced from [[93-df-finite-algebra]], [[93-df-cardinality]], and [[93-df-ultraproduct]]."},{"id":"98ea8403ba8386af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"03a4b56655d6ad49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d523f19a7e4590f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e2431dc0f64e0f95","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{Con}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-boolean-algebra]], [[93-df-finite-algebra]], and [[93-df-congruence]]."},{"id":"c65c768099ba0767","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b566884cfea35b9","anchor":"ref-2"